  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Changes since 1.1.74:\n- Abstractions.Sass.CIBuild is a development dependency: NuGet adds it with PrivateAssets=\"all\", so a project that is itself packed no longer passes it on. Add PrivateAssets=\"all\" to a reference that was added before.\n- New: an agent skill for AI coding agents (Claude Code, GitHub Copilot) that describes sassconfig.json, LibSass and DartSass, urls and errors. The build copies it into the nearest .claude or .agents folder of the repository, and only where one exists. SassAgentSkills=False turns it off; HerreruudAgentSkills chooses the folders instead.\n- Abstractions.Sass.CIBuild is about 2 MB smaller (System.Linq.Async removed).\n- Visual Studio: \"Enable compile on build\" adds the package without a dialog, and reports in the Output window.",
